# Infinite Carousel — a circular (wrap-around) carousel of calculator cards driven
# by a pan gesture (translateX starts at -500 laps), with rotateY/scale per item,
# snap points, tap-to-centre via scrollToIndex, and a Skia background gradient
# that animates to the active card's theme colour.
# What this test covers: tapping right/left neighbour cards (scrollToIndex picks
# the closest wrapped destination), small drags released under half a card (snap
# back), drags of several cards, fast flings in both directions that wrap around
# the list more than once, grabbing the carousel mid-spring (cancelAnimation),
# taps fired during a running spring, and settling.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/infinite-carousel"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait 1500
# Cards are ~84pt wide on y=437; centre card at x=201.
press 297 437
wait 1200
press 105 437
wait 1200
press 380 437
wait 1200
# Small drag (snaps back), then a 3-card drag.
gesture pan 201 437 -30 0 500
wait 1000
gesture pan 330 437 -250 0 800
wait 1200
gesture pan 70 437 250 0 800
wait 1200
# Fast flings: wrap the 10 themes more than once.
gesture fling left 340 437 280
wait 300
gesture fling left 340 437 280
wait 300
gesture fling left 340 437 280
wait 2000
gesture fling right 60 437 280
wait 200
# Grab while the spring is still moving.
gesture pan 201 437 60 0 300
wait 1500
# Taps during a running spring.
press 297 437
press 297 437
press 105 437
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
